# Task: Set up a collaboration group and shared directory

The user accounts `{{user_one}}` and `{{user_two}}` already exist on this system.

1. Create the group `{{group_name}}`.
2. Make `{{user_one}}` and `{{user_two}}` supplementary members of `{{group_name}}` without changing their primary groups.
3. Create the directory `{{shared_dir}}` configured so that:
   - Its group is `{{group_name}}`.
   - Members of `{{group_name}}` can create, modify and delete files in it.
   - Files and directories created inside it are automatically group-owned by `{{group_name}}`.
   - Users outside `{{group_name}}` (other than root) have no write access to it.
